;; go.tsg — placeholder stack-graphs rules for Go.
;;
;; Holds the architectural slot for a future `tree-sitter-stack-graphs-go`
;; integration. The bulk of Go cross-package resolution is done by
;; `cgg_resolve::cross_file` consuming the `package-root` and `import`
;; records emitted by the extractor.
;;
;; What a future real `go.tsg` would add: method dispatch on
;; receiver types, embedded-struct method promotion, interface
;; satisfaction, generic instantiation.

(source_file) @_root {
}
